---
import { Compass, Lightbulb, Users2, Target } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="mission" class="relative py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
    <!-- Left Column: The Manifesto -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
        <Target class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400" />
        <span>Our Guiding Purpose</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Democratizing entrepreneurship for every student on campus.
      </h2>

      <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-emerald-400 pl-6 py-2 text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-300 font-normal leading-relaxed italic">
        "To empower students across disciplines to develop entrepreneurial mindsets, explore emerging technologies, transform ideas into meaningful ventures, and build the skills and connections needed to create real-world impact."
      </blockquote>

      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        Historically, campus innovation was trapped in isolated silos. Computer science students wrote code without commercial distribution; business students built business plans without technical prototypes; liberal arts students were excluded from tech altogether. The <strong class="text-white">UOS Entrepreneurship Society</strong> shatters those boundaries.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Institutional Impact Cards -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1 gap-4">
      <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-emerald-400 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <Compass class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white mb-2">Cross-Disciplinary DNA</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Whether you study Management Sciences, English, Chemistry, or Software Engineering, your unique perspective is essential to building complete ventures.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-cyan-400 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <Lightbulb class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white mb-2">Applied over Theory</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          No abstract slides or dusty case studies. We write real code, run live user interviews, deploy production apps, and test business models in the market.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-2xl hover:border-teal-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-teal-500/10 border border-teal-500/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-teal-400 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          <Users2 class="w-5 h-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white mb-2">Ecosystem Connectivity</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Connecting Sahiwal with the national and global startup ecosystem through founder firesides, open-source initiatives, and venture networks.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
